1
00:00:00,837 --> 00:00:03,177
(Sheldon:)I always thought
I was more like a cuckoo bird.

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:07,380
(Sheldon:)A superior creature whose egg is placed
in the nest of ordinary birds.

3
00:00:07,552 --> 00:00:09,642
(Sheldon:)The newly hatched cuckoo
eats all the food...

4
00:00:09,804 --> 00:00:12,844
(Sheldon:)...leaving the ordinary siblings
to starve to death.

5
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:16,223
(Sheldon:)Luckily for you,
that's where the metaphor ended.

6
00:00:17,854 --> 00:00:20,064
(Missy:)I thought it ended at cuckoo.

7
00:00:22,442 --> 00:00:23,732
(Missy:)Now, you listen to me.

8
00:00:23,902 --> 00:00:27,152
If you wanna start acting like a brother
who cares about me, terrific.

9
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:28,990
(Missy:)Bring it on.

10
00:00:29,157 --> 00:00:32,077
(Missy:)But you try one time to tell me
who I should be sleeping with...

11
00:00:32,243 --> 00:00:37,043
...and you and I are gonna go round the way
we did when we were little. Remember?

12
00:00:40,543 --> 00:00:42,833
- I have an alternate proposal.
- Go on.

13
00:00:43,505 --> 00:00:46,545
(Sheldon:)You donate eggs.
We will place them in cryogenic storage.

14
00:00:46,716 --> 00:00:49,636
(Sheldon:)I will find an appropriate sperm donor
for your eggs...

15
00:00:49,803 --> 00:00:52,303
(Sheldon:)...have them fertilized
and implanted in you.

16
00:00:52,472 --> 00:01:03,022
(Sheldon:)That way, everybody wins.

